{"id":"mahabharata-6-050","work":"mahabharata","part":6,"partName":"भीष्मपर्व","partNameEn":"Bhishma Parva","unit":50,"title":"पञ्चाशत्तमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 50 · Bhima destroys the Kalinga army","summary":{"en":"The Kalinga king and his sons attack Bhima, who cuts them down with his sword and club and slays great numbers. Dhrishtadyumna praises him, and the fight goes on.","kn":"ಕಳಿಂಗರಾಜ ಮತ್ತು ಅವನ ಮಕ್ಕಳು ಭೀಮನ ಮೇಲೆ ದಾಳಿ ಮಾಡುತ್ತಾರೆ; ಭೀಮ ಖಡ್ಗ, ಗದೆಗಳಿಂದ ಅವರನ್ನು ಕಡಿದು ಅನೇಕರನ್ನು ಕೊಲ್ಲುತ್ತಾನೆ. ಧೃಷ್ಟದ್ಯುಮ್ನ ಅವನನ್ನು ಹೊಗಳುತ್ತಾನೆ, ಹೋರಾಟ ಮುಂದುವರಿಯುತ್ತದೆ.","hi":"कलिंग राजा और उसके पुत्र भीम पर आक्रमण करते हैं; भीम तलवार और गदा से उन्हें काटकर बहुतों को मारते हैं। धृष्टद्युम्न उनकी प्रशंसा करते हैं और युद्ध चलता रहता है।","te":"కళింగరాజు, అతని కుమారులు భీముని మీద దాడి చేస్తారు; భీముడు ఖడ్గం, గదలతో వారిని నరికి అనేకులను చంపుతాడు. ధృష్టద్యుమ్నుడు అతన్ని ప్రశంసిస్తాడు, పోరు కొనసాగుతుంది.","ta":"கலிங்க மன்னனும் அவன் மகன்களும் பீமனைத் தாக்க, பீமன் வாளாலும் கதையாலும் அவர்களை வெட்டிப் பலரைக் கொல்கிறான். த்ருஷ்டத்யும்னன் அவனைப் பாராட்டுகிறான், போர் தொடர்கிறது.","ml":"കലിംഗരാജാവും പുത്രന്മാരും ഭീമനെ ആക്രമിക്കുന്നു; ഭീമൻ വാളും ഗദയും കൊണ്ട് അവരെ വെട്ടിവീഴ്ത്തി വലിയ സംഖ്യ കൊല്ലുന്നു. ധൃഷ്ടദ്യുമ്നൻ അദ്ദേഹത്തെ പ്രശംസിക്കുന്നു; യുദ്ധം തുടരുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 6.50; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Mon Jul 26 2021","sections":[{"title":"भीष्मवधपर्व","titleEn":"Bhishmavadha Parva (The fall of Bhishma)","verses":[{"text":"धृतराष्ट्र उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Dhritarashtra said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"तथा प्रतिसमादिष्टः कलिङ्गो वाहिनीपतिः ।\nकथमद्भुतकर्माणं भीमसेनं महाबलम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Thus commanded, how did the Kalinga, the leader of an army, fight, with his troops in battle, the mighty Bhimasena of wondrous deeds,"}},{"n":2,"text":"चरन्तं गदया वीरं दण्डपाणिमिवान्तकम् ।\nयोधयामास समरे कलिङ्गः सह सेनया ॥","meaning":{"en":"who ranged about with his mace, a hero like Death with his staff in hand?"}},{"text":"संजय उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Sanjaya said:"}},{"n":3,"text":"पुत्रेण तव राजेन्द्र स तथोक्तो महाबलः ।\nमहत्या सेनया गुप्तः प्रायाद्भीमरथं प्रति ॥","meaning":{"en":"Thus addressed by your son, O king of kings, the mighty Kalinga, guarded by a great army, advanced toward Bhima's chariot."}},{"n":4,"text":"तामापतन्तीं सहसा कलिङ्गानां महाचमूम् ।\nरथनागाश्वकलिलां प्रगृहीतमहायुधाम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bhimasena, O Bharata, met the Kalinga host as it suddenly rushed on, crowded with chariots, elephants and horses, with great weapons raised,"}},{"n":5,"text":"भीमसेनः कलिङ्गानामार्छद्भारत वाहिनीम् ।\nकेतुमन्तं च नैषादिमायान्तं सह चेदिभिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"and Ketuman, the Nishada king, coming with the Chedis."}},{"n":6,"text":"ततः श्रुतायुः संक्रुद्धो राज्ञा केतुमता सह ।\nआससाद रणे भीमं व्यूढानीकेषु चेदिषु ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Shrutayu, in fury, with King Ketuman, met Bhima in battle, while the Chedis stood in battle array."}},{"n":7,"text":"रथैरनेकसाहस्रैः कलिङ्गानां जनाधिपः ।\nअयुतेन गजानां च निषादैः सह केतुमान् ।\nभीमसेनं रणे राजन्समन्तात्पर्यवारयत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"The lord of the Kalingas with many thousands of chariots, and Ketuman with ten thousand elephants and the Nishadas, surrounded Bhimasena in the battle on every side, O king."}},{"n":8,"text":"चेदिमत्स्यकरूषाश्च भीमसेनपुरोगमाः ।\nअभ्यवर्तन्त सहसा निषादान्सह राजभिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"The Chedis, Matsyas and Karushas, led by Bhimasena, suddenly attacked the Nishadas and the kings."}},{"n":9,"text":"ततः प्रववृते युद्धं घोररूपं भयानकम् ।\nप्रजानन्न च योधान्स्वान्परस्परजिघांसया ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then a dreadful and terrifying battle began, in which, in their eagerness to kill, men did not even know their own warriors."}},{"n":10,"text":"घोरमासीत्ततो युद्धं भीमस्य सहसा परैः ।\nयथेन्द्रस्य महाराज महत्या दैत्यसेनया ॥","meaning":{"en":"Fierce was the battle of Bhima against his many enemies, great king, as Indra's was against the great army of the daityas."}},{"n":11,"text":"तस्य सैन्यस्य संग्रामे युध्यमानस्य भारत ।\nबभूव सुमहाञ्शब्दः सागरस्येव गर्जतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"From that army fighting in the battle, O Bharata, a great noise arose, like the roaring of the sea."}},{"n":12,"text":"अन्योन्यस्य तदा योधा निकृन्तन्तो विशां पते ।\nमहीं चक्रुश्चितां सर्वां शशशोणितसंनिभाम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Warriors cutting one another down, lord of the people, made all the ground red as with hare's blood."}},{"n":13,"text":"योधांश्च स्वान्परान्वापि नाभ्यजानञ्जिघांसया ।\nस्वानप्याददते स्वाश्च शूराः समरदुर्जयाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Those hard-to-conquer heroes did not know their own men from the enemy in their eagerness to kill, and even struck their own."}},{"n":14,"text":"विमर्दः सुमहानासीदल्पानां बहुभिः सह ।\nकलिङ्गैः सह चेदीनां निषादैश्च विशां पते ॥","meaning":{"en":"There was a great crush of the few against the many, of the Chedis against the Kalingas and Nishadas, lord of the people."}},{"n":15,"text":"कृत्वा पुरुषकारं तु यथाशक्ति महाबलाः ।\nभीमसेनं परित्यज्य संन्यवर्तन्त चेदयः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having done what they could, the mighty Chedis left Bhimasena and turned back."}},{"n":16,"text":"सर्वैः कलिङ्गैरासन्नः संनिवृत्तेषु चेदिषु ।\nस्वबाहुबलमास्थाय न न्यवर्तत पाण्डवः ॥","meaning":{"en":"With the Chedis turned back, and all the Kalingas close upon him, the Pandava, relying on the strength of his own arms, did not turn back."}},{"n":17,"text":"न चचाल रथोपस्थाद्भीमसेनो महाबलः ।\nशितैरवाकिरन्बाणैः कलिङ्गानां वरूथिनीम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Mighty Bhimasena did not move from his chariot seat, and covered the Kalinga army with sharp arrows."}},{"n":18,"text":"कलिङ्गस्तु महेष्वासः पुत्रश्चास्य महारथः ।\nशक्रदेव इति ख्यातो जघ्नतुः पाण्डवं शरैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"The great archer, the Kalinga, and his son, the great chariot-warrior known as Shakradeva, struck the Pandava with arrows."}},{"n":19,"text":"ततो भीमो महाबाहुर्विधुन्वन्रुचिरं धनुः ।\nयोधयामास कालिङ्गान्स्वबाहुबलमाश्रितः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then mighty-armed Bhima, shaking his beautiful bow, relying on the strength of his own arms, fought the Kalingas."}},{"n":20,"text":"शक्रदेवस्तु समरे विसृजन्सायकान्बहून् ।\nअश्वाञ्जघान समरे भीमसेनस्य सायकैः ।\nववर्ष शरवर्षाणि तपान्ते जलदो यथा ॥","meaning":{"en":"Shakradeva, loosing many arrows in the battle, killed Bhimasena's horses with his shafts, and rained showers of arrows like a cloud at summer's end."}},{"n":21,"text":"हताश्वे तु रथे तिष्ठन्भीमसेनो महाबलः ।\nशक्रदेवाय चिक्षेप सर्वशैक्यायसीं गदाम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Standing in his chariot with its horses dead, mighty Bhimasena hurled at Shakradeva a mace made wholly of iron."}},{"n":22,"text":"स तया निहतो राजन्कलिङ्गस्य सुतो रथात् ।\nसध्वजः सह सूतेन जगाम धरणीतलम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Struck by that, O king, the Kalinga's son fell from his chariot to the ground, with his banner and charioteer."}},{"n":23,"text":"हतमात्मसुतं दृष्ट्वा कलिङ्गानां जनाधिपः ।\nरथैरनेकसाहस्रैर्भीमस्यावारयद्दिशः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing his own son killed, the lord of the Kalingas blocked Bhima's directions with many thousands of chariots."}},{"n":24,"text":"ततो भीमो महाबाहुर्गुर्वीं त्यक्त्वा महागदाम् ।\nउद्बबर्हाथ निस्त्रिंशं चिकीर्षुः कर्म दारुणम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then mighty-armed Bhima, throwing aside his heavy great mace, drew a sword, wishing to do a terrible deed."}},{"n":25,"text":"चर्म चाप्रतिमं राजन्नार्षभं पुरुषर्षभ ।\nनक्षत्रैरर्धचन्द्रैश्च शातकुम्भमयैश्चितम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"He took, O king, a matchless shield of bull-hide, bull among men, studded with stars and half-moons made of gold."}},{"n":26,"text":"कलिङ्गस्तु ततः क्रुद्धो धनुर्ज्यामवमृज्य ह ।\nप्रगृह्य च शरं घोरमेकं सर्पविषोपमम् ।\nप्राहिणोद्भीमसेनाय वधाकाङ्क्षी जनेश्वरः ॥","meaning":{"en":"The Kalinga then, in anger, wiped his bowstring, took up one dreadful arrow like snake venom, and shot it at Bhimasena, wishing to kill him, that lord of men."}},{"n":27,"text":"तमापतन्तं वेगेन प्रेरितं निशितं शरम् ।\nभीमसेनो द्विधा राजंश्चिच्छेद विपुलासिना ।\nउदक्रोशच्च संहृष्टस्त्रासयानो वरूथिनीम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"As that sharp arrow came on, driven with speed, Bhimasena cut it in two, O king, with his broad sword, and roared in delight, terrifying the army."}},{"n":28,"text":"कलिङ्गस्तु ततः क्रुद्धो भीमसेनाय संयुगे ।\nतोमरान्प्राहिणोच्छीघ्रं चतुर्दश शिलाशितान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"The Kalinga, enraged, quickly sent fourteen stone-whetted lances at Bhimasena in the battle."}},{"n":29,"text":"तानप्राप्तान्महाबाहुः खगतानेव पाण्डवः ।\nचिच्छेद सहसा राजन्नसंभ्रान्तो वरासिना ॥","meaning":{"en":"The mighty-armed Pandava, unflustered, cut them down with his fine sword, O king, while they were still in the air, before they reached him."}},{"n":30,"text":"निकृत्य तु रणे भीमस्तोमरान्वै चतुर्दश ।\nभानुमन्तमभिप्रेक्ष्य प्राद्रवत्पुरुषर्षभः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having cut down the fourteen lances in battle, Bhima, bull among men, saw Bhanuman and ran at him."}},{"n":31,"text":"भानुमांस्तु ततो भीमं शरवर्षेण छादयन् ।\nननाद बलवन्नादं नादयानो नभस्तलम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bhanuman then, covering Bhima with a shower of arrows, gave a mighty roar that filled the sky."}},{"n":32,"text":"न तं स ममृषे भीमः सिंहनादं महारणे ।\nततः स्वरेण महता विननाद महास्वनम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bhima could not bear that lion-roar in the great battle, and roared in return with a great loud cry."}},{"n":33,"text":"तेन शब्देन वित्रस्ता कलिङ्गानां वरूथिनी ।\nन भीमं समरे मेने मानुषं भरतर्षभ ॥","meaning":{"en":"Terrified by that sound, the Kalinga army, O best of the Bharatas, did not take Bhima for a man in the battle."}},{"n":34,"text":"ततो भीमो महाराज नदित्वा विपुलं स्वनम् ।\nसासिर्वेगादवप्लुत्य दन्ताभ्यां वारणोत्तमम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, great king, Bhima, having given a loud roar, with his sword leaped swiftly onto the tusks of the best of elephants."}},{"n":35,"text":"आरुरोह ततो मध्यं नागराजस्य मारिष ।\nखड्गेन पृथुना मध्ये भानुमन्तमथाच्छिनत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then he climbed to the middle of that king of elephants, sir, and with his broad sword cut Bhanuman in two at the waist."}},{"n":36,"text":"सोऽन्तरायुधिनं हत्वा राजपुत्रमरिंदमः ।\nगुरुभारसहस्कन्धे नागस्यासिमपातयत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having killed that prince, who was without a weapon in his hand, the foe-subduer dropped his sword on the heavy-burdened shoulder of the elephant."}},{"n":37,"text":"छिन्नस्कन्धः स विनदन्पपात गजयूथपः ।\nआरुग्णः सिन्धुवेगेन सानुमानिव पर्वतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"With its shoulder cut, the leader of the herd fell, bellowing, like a mountain with its peaks broken by the force of a flood."}},{"n":38,"text":"ततस्तस्मादवप्लुत्य गजाद्भारत भारतः ।\nखड्गपाणिरदीनात्मा अतिष्ठद्भुवि दंशितः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the Bharata, O Bharata, leaping from that elephant, stood on the ground armored, with sword in hand and unbroken spirit."}},{"n":39,"text":"स चचार बहून्मार्गानभीतः पातयन्गजान् ।\nअग्निचक्रमिवाविद्धं सर्वतः प्रत्यदृश्यत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Fearless, he moved in many paths, felling elephants, and he was seen everywhere like a whirling fire-wheel."}},{"n":40,"text":"अश्ववृन्देषु नागेषु रथानीकेषु चाभिभूः ।\nपदातीनां च संघेषु विनिघ्नञ्शोणितोक्षितः ।\nश्येनवद्व्यचरद्भीमो रणे रिपुबलोत्कटः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Among masses of horses, elephants and chariot divisions and throngs of foot soldiers, smeared with blood, the mighty Bhima, fierce against the enemy force, ranged like a hawk in the battle."}},{"n":41,"text":"छिन्दंस्तेषां शरीराणि शिरांसि च महाजवः ।\nखड्गेन शितधारेण संयुगे गजयोधिनाम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"With great speed he cut down the bodies and heads of the elephant-fighters in the battle with his sharp sword."}},{"n":42,"text":"पदातिरेकः संक्रुद्धः शत्रूणां भयवर्धनः ।\nमोहयामास च तदा कालान्तकयमोपमः ॥","meaning":{"en":"A lone footman, furious, raising the fear of his enemies, he bewildered them, like Yama, the ender of time."}},{"n":43,"text":"मूढाश्च ते तमेवाजौ विनदन्तः समाद्रवन् ।\nसासिमुत्तमवेगेन विचरन्तं महारणे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bewildered, they rushed at him in the fight, roaring, as he moved in the great battle with his sword at supreme speed."}},{"n":44,"text":"निकृत्य रथिनामाजौ रथेषाश्च युगानि च ।\nजघान रथिनश्चापि बलवानरिमर्दनः ॥","meaning":{"en":"The strong crusher of foes cut down chariot-poles and yokes of chariot-warriors in the battle and killed the chariot-warriors too."}},{"n":45,"text":"भीमसेनश्चरन्मार्गान्सुबहून्प्रत्यदृश्यत ।\nभ्रान्तमुद्भ्रान्तमाविद्धमाप्लुतं प्रसृतं सृतम् ।\nसंपातं समुदीर्यं च दर्शयामास पाण्डवः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bhimasena was seen moving along many paths; the Pandava showed the moves called bhranta, udbhranta, avidha, apluta, prasrita, srita, sampata and samudiryam."}},{"n":46,"text":"केचिदग्रासिना छिन्नाः पाण्डवेन महात्मना ।\nविनेदुर्भिन्नमर्माणो निपेतुश्च गतासवः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Some, cut by the great-souled Pandava's sword-edge, cried out with their vitals pierced and fell lifeless."}},{"n":47,"text":"छिन्नदन्ताग्रहस्ताश्च भिन्नकुम्भास्तथापरे ।\nवियोधाः स्वान्यनीकानि जघ्नुर्भारत वारणाः ।\nनिपेतुरुर्व्यां च तथा विनदन्तो महारवान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Elephants with the tips of their tusks and trunks cut, others with their temples split, and now without warriors, trampled their own ranks, O Bharata, and fell on the earth bellowing great roars."}},{"n":48,"text":"छिन्नांश्च तोमरांश्चापान्महामात्रशिरांसि च ।\nपरिस्तोमानि चित्राणि कक्ष्याश्च कनकोज्ज्वलाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"There we saw cut spears, bows, heads of mahouts, varied elephant-cloths, and gold-bright girths,"}},{"n":49,"text":"ग्रैवेयाण्यथ शक्तीश्च पताकाः कणपांस्तथा ।\nतूणीराण्यथ यन्त्राणि विचित्राणि धनूंषि च ॥","meaning":{"en":"neck-chains, spears, flags, goads, quivers, machines, and varied bows,"}},{"n":50,"text":"अग्निकुण्डानि शुभ्राणि तोत्त्रांश्चैवाङ्कुशैः सह ।\nघण्टाश्च विविधा राजन्हेमगर्भांस्त्सरूनपि ।\nपततः पतितांश्चैव पश्यामः सह सादिभिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"bright fire-pots, goads and prods, bells of various kinds, ladles with golden hearts, O king, and elephants with their riders falling and fallen."}},{"n":51,"text":"छिन्नगात्रावरकरैर्निहतैश्चापि वारणैः ।\nआसीत्तस्मिन्समास्तीर्णा पतितैर्भूर्नगैरिव ॥","meaning":{"en":"With their bodies, trunks, armor and mighty ones felled, the ground there was spread over with fallen elephants as with mountains."}},{"n":52,"text":"विमृद्यैवं महानागान्ममर्दाश्वान्नरर्षभः ।\nअश्वारोहवरांश्चापि पातयामास भारत ।\nतद्घोरमभवद्युद्धं तस्य तेषां च भारत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Thus crushing great elephants, the bull among men crushed horses too, and felled the best horsemen, O Bharata. That battle between him and them was terrible."}},{"n":53,"text":"खलीनान्यथ योक्त्राणि कशाश्च कनकोज्ज्वलाः ।\nपरिस्तोमाश्च प्रासाश्च ऋष्टयश्च महाधनाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bits, reins, golden whips, saddle-cloths, spears and costly lances,"}},{"n":54,"text":"कवचान्यथ चर्माणि चित्राण्यास्तरणानि च ।\nतत्र तत्रापविद्धानि व्यदृश्यन्त महाहवे ॥","meaning":{"en":"armor, shields and varied coverings were seen thrown here and there in the great battle."}},{"n":55,"text":"प्रोथयन्त्रैर्विचित्रैश्च शस्त्रैश्च विमलैस्तथा ।\nस चक्रे वसुधां कीर्णां शबलैः कुसुमैरिव ॥","meaning":{"en":"With many-colored bridle-fittings and bright weapons he made the earth strewn as with variegated flowers."}},{"n":56,"text":"आप्लुत्य रथिनः कांश्चित्परामृश्य महाबलः ।\nपातयामास खड्गेन सध्वजानपि पाण्डवः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Leaping, the mighty Pandava seized some chariot-warriors and felled them with his sword, banners and all."}},{"n":57,"text":"मुहुरुत्पततो दिक्षु धावतश्च यशस्विनः ।\nमार्गांश्च चरतश्चित्रान्व्यस्मयन्त रणे जनाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing the renowned man leap again and again, run in all directions and move along strange paths, people in the battle were amazed."}},{"n":58,"text":"निजघान पदा कांश्चिदाक्षिप्यान्यानपोथयत् ।\nखड्गेनान्यांश्च चिच्छेद नादेनान्यांश्च भीषयन् ॥","meaning":{"en":"He killed some with a kick, flung and crushed others, cut others with his sword and terrified others with his roar."}},{"n":59,"text":"ऊरुवेगेन चाप्यन्यान्पातयामास भूतले ।\nअपरे चैनमालोक्य भयात्पञ्चत्वमागताः ॥","meaning":{"en":"He knocked others to the ground with the force of his thighs, and others, merely seeing him, died of fear."}},{"n":60,"text":"एवं सा बहुला सेना कलिङ्गानां तरस्विनाम् ।\nपरिवार्य रणे भीष्मं भीमसेनमुपाद्रवत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"So that great army of the mighty Kalingas, surrounding Bhishma in the battle, rushed on Bhimasena."}},{"n":61,"text":"ततः कलिङ्गसैन्यानां प्रमुखे भरतर्षभ ।\nश्रुतायुषमभिप्रेक्ष्य भीमसेनः समभ्ययात् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, O best of the Bharatas, at the head of the Kalinga troops, Bhimasena saw Shrutayu and advanced against him."}},{"n":62,"text":"तमायान्तमभिप्रेक्ष्य कलिङ्गो नवभिः शरैः ।\nभीमसेनममेयात्मा प्रत्यविध्यत्स्तनान्तरे ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing him come, the boundless Kalinga struck Bhimasena in the chest with nine arrows."}},{"n":63,"text":"कलिङ्गबाणाभिहतस्तोत्त्रार्दित इव द्विपः ।\nभीमसेनः प्रजज्वाल क्रोधेनाग्निरिवेन्धनैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Struck by the Kalinga's arrows, like an elephant tormented by the goad, Bhimasena blazed with anger like a fire with fuel."}},{"n":64,"text":"अथाशोकः समादाय रथं हेमपरिष्कृतम् ।\nभीमं संपादयामास रथेन रथसारथिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Ashoka brought a golden chariot and, as charioteer, brought it to Bhima."}},{"n":65,"text":"तमारुह्य रथं तूर्णं कौन्तेयः शत्रुसूदनः ।\nकलिङ्गमभिदुद्राव तिष्ठ तिष्ठेति चाब्रवीत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Climbing quickly into that chariot, the son of Kunti, slayer of foes, rushed at the Kalinga, saying, \"Stand, stand!\""}},{"n":66,"text":"ततः श्रुतायुर्बलवान्भीमाय निशिताञ्शरान् ।\nप्रेषयामास संक्रुद्धो दर्शयन्पाणिलाघवम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then strong Shrutayu, enraged, sent sharp arrows at Bhima, showing the quickness of his hand."}},{"n":67,"text":"स कार्मुकवरोत्सृष्टैर्नवभिर्निशितैः शरैः ।\nसमाहतो भृशं राजन्कलिङ्गेन महायशाः ।\nसंचुक्रुधे भृशं भीमो दण्डाहत इवोरगः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Struck hard, O king, by the Kalinga with nine sharp arrows shot from his excellent bow, the very famous Bhima was greatly enraged, like a snake struck by a stick."}},{"n":68,"text":"क्रुद्धश्च चापमायम्य बलवद्बलिनां वरः ।\nकलिङ्गमवधीत्पार्थो भीमः सप्तभिरायसैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Angered, Bhima, best of the strong, drew his bow with force and struck the Kalinga with seven iron arrows."}},{"n":69,"text":"क्षुराभ्यां चक्ररक्षौ च कलिङ्गस्य महाबलौ ।\nसत्यदेवं च सत्यं च प्राहिणोद्यमसादनम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"With two razor-headed arrows he sent the two mighty wheel-guards of the Kalinga, Satyadeva and Satya, to Yama's abode."}},{"n":70,"text":"ततः पुनरमेयात्मा नाराचैर्निशितैस्त्रिभिः ।\nकेतुमन्तं रणे भीमोऽगमयद्यमसादनम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then again the boundless Bhima, with three sharp iron arrows, sent Ketuman to Yama's abode in the battle."}},{"n":71,"text":"ततः कलिङ्गाः संक्रुद्धा भीमसेनममर्षणम् ।\nअनीकैर्बहुसाहस्रैः क्षत्रियाः समवारयन् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then the Kalingas, enraged, the kshatriyas, surrounded the furious Bhimasena with many thousands of divisions."}},{"n":72,"text":"ततः शक्तिगदाखड्गतोमरर्ष्टिपरश्वधैः ।\nकलिङ्गाश्च ततो राजन्भीमसेनमवाकिरन् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, O king, the Kalingas covered Bhimasena with spears, maces, swords, lances, javelins and axes."}},{"n":73,"text":"संनिवार्य स तां घोरां शरवृष्टिं समुत्थिताम् ।\nगदामादाय तरसा परिप्लुत्य महाबलः ।\nभीमः सप्तशतान्वीराननयद्यमसादनम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having checked that terrible downpour of arrows that had arisen, the mighty Bhima took his mace, leapt swiftly, and sent seven hundred heroes to Yama's abode."}},{"n":74,"text":"पुनश्चैव द्विसाहस्रान्कलिङ्गानरिमर्दनः ।\nप्राहिणोन्मृत्युलोकाय तदद्भुतमिवाभवत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Again the crusher of foes sent two thousand Kalingas to the world of death; that seemed a wonder."}},{"n":75,"text":"एवं स तान्यनीकानि कलिङ्गानां पुनः पुनः ।\nबिभेद समरे वीरः प्रेक्ष्य भीष्मं महाव्रतम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Thus again and again he broke those Kalinga divisions in the battle, while looking at Bhishma of great vows."}},{"n":76,"text":"हतारोहाश्च मातङ्गाः पाण्डवेन महात्मना ।\nविप्रजग्मुरनीकेषु मेघा वातहता इव ।\nमृद्नन्तः स्वान्यनीकानि विनदन्तः शरातुराः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Elephants whose riders were killed by the great-souled Pandava fled through the ranks like clouds struck by wind, trampling their own divisions and bellowing, tormented by arrows."}},{"n":77,"text":"ततो भीमो महाबाहुः शङ्खं प्राध्मापयद्बली ।\nसर्वकालिङ्गसैन्यानां मनांसि समकम्पयत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then mighty-armed and strong Bhima blew his conch and shook the minds of all the Kalinga armies."}},{"n":78,"text":"मोहश्चापि कलिङ्गानामाविवेश परंतप ।\nप्राकम्पन्त च सैन्यानि वाहनानि च सर्वशः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bewilderment, too, entered the Kalingas, O scorcher of foes, and the armies and mounts all trembled."}},{"n":79,"text":"भीमेन समरे राजन्गजेन्द्रेणेव सर्वतः ।\nमार्गान्बहून्विचरता धावता च ततस्ततः ।\nमुहुरुत्पतता चैव संमोहः समजायत ॥","meaning":{"en":"With Bhima moving about everywhere like a king of elephants, running here and there along many paths and leaping again and again, confusion arose."}},{"n":80,"text":"भीमसेनभयत्रस्तं सैन्यं च समकम्पत ।\nक्षोभ्यमाणमसंबाधं ग्राहेणेव महत्सरः ॥","meaning":{"en":"The army, struck with fear of Bhimasena, shook like a great lake that is churned, though unobstructed, by a crocodile."}},{"n":81,"text":"त्रासितेषु च वीरेषु भीमेनाद्भुतकर्मणा ।\nपुनरावर्तमानेषु विद्रवत्सु च संघशः ॥","meaning":{"en":"When the heroes had been terrified by Bhima of wondrous deeds, and were turning back and fleeing in crowds,"}},{"n":82,"text":"सर्वकालिङ्गयोधेषु पाण्डूनां ध्वजिनीपतिः ।\nअब्रवीत्स्वान्यनीकानि युध्यध्वमिति पार्षतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"the leader of the Pandava host, the son of Prishata, said to his own divisions, with all the Kalinga warriors in the field, \"Fight!\""}},{"n":83,"text":"सेनापतिवचः श्रुत्वा शिखण्डिप्रमुखा गणाः ।\nभीममेवाभ्यवर्तन्त रथानीकैः प्रहारिभिः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Hearing the commander's words, the troops led by Shikhandi, with strong chariot-divisions, advanced on Bhima alone."}},{"n":84,"text":"धर्मराजश्च तान्सर्वानुपजग्राह पाण्डवः ।\nमहता मेघवर्णेन नागानीकेन पृष्ठतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"And the Pandava king of dharma supported them all from behind with a great elephant division, dark as a cloud."}},{"n":85,"text":"एवं संचोद्य सर्वाणि स्वान्यनीकानि पार्षतः ।\nभीमसेनस्य जग्राह पार्ष्णिं सत्पुरुषोचिताम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having thus urged on all his divisions, Prishata's son took the rear-guard position for Bhimasena, as a good man would."}},{"n":86,"text":"न हि पाञ्चालराजस्य लोके कश्चन विद्यते ।\nभीमसात्यकयोरन्यः प्राणेभ्यः प्रियकृत्तमः ॥","meaning":{"en":"For in the world the king of the Panchalas had no one dearer than his own life except Bhima and Satyaki."}},{"n":87,"text":"सोऽपश्यत्तं कलिङ्गेषु चरन्तमरिसूदनम् ।\nभीमसेनं महाबाहुं पार्षतः परवीरहा ॥","meaning":{"en":"The son of Prishata, slayer of enemy heroes, saw mighty-armed Bhimasena, destroyer of his enemies, ranging among the Kalingas."}},{"n":88,"text":"ननर्द बहुधा राजन्हृष्टश्चासीत्परंतपः ।\nशङ्खं दध्मौ च समरे सिंहनादं ननाद च ॥","meaning":{"en":"He roared many times, O king, and the scorcher of foes was delighted; he blew his conch in the battle and made a lion-roar."}},{"n":89,"text":"स च पारावताश्वस्य रथे हेमपरिष्कृते ।\nकोविदारध्वजं दृष्ट्वा भीमसेनः समाश्वसत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing Dhrishtadyumna's banner of the kovidara tree on a gold-adorned chariot with dove-colored horses, Bhimasena was reassured."}},{"n":90,"text":"धृष्टद्युम्नस्तु तं दृष्ट्वा कलिङ्गैः समभिद्रुतम् ।\nभीमसेनममेयात्मा त्राणायाजौ समभ्ययात् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Dhrishtadyumna, boundless, seeing Bhimasena pressed by the Kalingas, went to his protection in the battle."}},{"n":91,"text":"तौ दूरात्सात्यकिर्दृष्ट्वा धृष्टद्युम्नवृकोदरौ ।\nकलिङ्गान्समरे वीरौ योधयन्तौ मनस्विनौ ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing from afar Dhrishtadyumna and Vrikodara, both heroes and high-minded, fighting the Kalingas in the battle,"}},{"n":92,"text":"स तत्र गत्वा शैनेयो जवेन जयतां वरः ।\nपार्थपार्षतयोः पार्ष्णिं जग्राह पुरुषर्षभः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Satyaki, the Shini warrior, best of conquerors, going there swiftly, bull among men, took up the rear-guard position for Partha and Prishata's son."}},{"n":93,"text":"स कृत्वा कदनं तत्र प्रगृहीतशरासनः ।\nआस्थितो रौद्रमात्मानं जघान समरे परान् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having done slaughter there, with his bow in hand, in his terrible form he struck down the enemy in the battle."}},{"n":94,"text":"कलिङ्गप्रभवां चैव मांसशोणितकर्दमाम् ।\nरुधिरस्यन्दिनीं तत्र भीमः प्रावर्तयन्नदीम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bhima there made a river flow, born of the Kalingas, a mire of flesh and blood, running with gore."}},{"n":95,"text":"अन्तरेण कलिङ्गानां पाण्डवानां च वाहिनीम् ।\nसंततार सुदुस्तारां भीमसेनो महाबलः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Mighty Bhimasena crossed the hard-to-cross river that lay between the Kalinga army and the Pandava army."}},{"n":96,"text":"भीमसेनं तथा दृष्ट्वा प्राक्रोशंस्तावका नृप ।\nकालोऽयं भीमरूपेण कलिङ्गैः सह युध्यते ॥","meaning":{"en":"Seeing Bhimasena thus, your men cried out, O king: \"This is Death in Bhima's form, fighting with the Kalingas.\""}},{"n":97,"text":"ततः शांतनवो भीष्मः श्रुत्वा तं निनदं रणे ।\nअभ्ययात्त्वरितो भीमं व्यूढानीकः समन्ततः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Bhishma, son of Shantanu, hearing that cry in the battle, hastened to Bhima, with his army arrayed on all sides."}},{"n":98,"text":"तं सात्यकिर्भीमसेनो धृष्टद्युम्नश्च पार्षतः ।\nअभ्यद्रवन्त भीष्मस्य रथं हेमपरिष्कृतम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Satyaki, Bhimasena and Dhrishtadyumna, son of Prishata, rushed at Bhishma's gold-adorned chariot."}},{"n":99,"text":"परिवार्य च ते सर्वे गाङ्गेयं रभसं रणे ।\nत्रिभिस्त्रिभिः शरैर्घोरैर्भीष्ममानर्छुरञ्जसा ॥","meaning":{"en":"Surrounding the furious son of Ganga in the battle, they all quickly struck Bhishma with three dreadful arrows each."}},{"n":100,"text":"प्रत्यविध्यत तान्सर्वान्पिता देवव्रतस्तव ।\nयतमानान्महेष्वासांस्त्रिभिस्त्रिभिरजिह्मगैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Your father, Devavrata, struck back at all those great archers as they strove, with three straight-flying arrows each."}},{"n":101,"text":"ततः शरसहस्रेण संनिवार्य महारथान् ।\nहयान्काञ्चनसंनाहान्भीमस्य न्यहनच्छरैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, checking those great chariot-warriors with a thousand arrows, he killed with his shafts Bhima's gold-armored horses."}},{"n":102,"text":"हताश्वे तु रथे तिष्ठन्भीमसेनः प्रतापवान् ।\nशक्तिं चिक्षेप तरसा गाङ्गेयस्य रथं प्रति ॥","meaning":{"en":"Standing in his chariot with its horses killed, mighty Bhimasena hurled a spear swiftly at the son of Ganga's chariot."}},{"n":103,"text":"अप्राप्तामेव तां शक्तिं पिता देवव्रतस्तव ।\nत्रिधा चिच्छेद समरे सा पृथिव्यामशीर्यत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Your father Devavrata cut that spear into three pieces before it reached him, and it fell shattered on the ground."}},{"n":104,"text":"ततः शैक्यायसीं गुर्वीं प्रगृह्य बलवद्गदाम् ।\nभीमसेनो रथात्तूर्णं पुप्लुवे मनुजर्षभ ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Bhimasena, taking a heavy, strong mace made wholly of iron, leaped quickly down from his chariot, best of men."}},{"n":105,"text":"सात्यकोऽपि ततस्तूर्णं भीमस्य प्रियकाम्यया ।\nसारथिं कुरुवृद्धस्य पातयामास सायकैः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Satyaki too, quickly, wishing to please Bhima, felled the charioteer of the elder of the Kurus with arrows."}},{"n":106,"text":"भीष्मस्तु निहते तस्मिन्सारथौ रथिनां वरः ।\nवातायमानैस्तैरश्वैरपनीतो रणाजिरात् ॥","meaning":{"en":"With his charioteer killed, Bhishma, best of chariot-warriors, was carried from the battlefield by his horses, which ran like the wind."}},{"n":107,"text":"भीमसेनस्ततो राजन्नपनीते महाव्रते ।\nप्रजज्वाल यथा वह्निर्दहन्कक्षमिवैधितः ॥","meaning":{"en":"With the great-vowed one carried away, O king, Bhimasena blazed like a fire fed and burning dry grass."}},{"n":108,"text":"स हत्वा सर्वकालिङ्गान्सेनामध्ये व्यतिष्ठत ।\nनैनमभ्युत्सहन्केचित्तावका भरतर्षभ ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having killed all the Kalingas, he stood in the middle of the army, and none of your men dared go against him, best of the Bharatas."}},{"n":109,"text":"धृष्टद्युम्नस्तमारोप्य स्वरथे रथिनां वरः ।\nपश्यतां सर्वसैन्यानामपोवाह यशस्विनम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Dhrishtadyumna, best of chariot-warriors, lifted him onto his own chariot and carried the renowned one away before the eyes of all the armies."}},{"n":110,"text":"संपूज्यमानः पाञ्चाल्यैर्मत्स्यैश्च भरतर्षभ ।\nधृष्टद्युम्नं परिष्वज्य समेयादथ सात्यकिम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Honored by the Panchalas and Matsyas, O best of the Bharatas, Bhima embraced Dhrishtadyumna and then met Satyaki."}},{"n":111,"text":"अथाब्रवीद्भीमसेनं सात्यकिः सत्यविक्रमः ।\nप्रहर्षयन्यदुव्याघ्रो धृष्टद्युम्नस्य पश्यतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then Satyaki, of true valor, tiger of the Yadavas, gladdening Bhima in the sight of Dhrishtadyumna, said:"}},{"n":112,"text":"दिष्ट्या कलिङ्गराजश्च राजपुत्रश्च केतुमान् ।\nशक्रदेवश्च कालिङ्गः कलिङ्गाश्च मृधे हताः ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"By good fortune, the king of Kalinga, the prince Ketuman, Shakradeva, and the Kalingas have been slain in the fight.\""}},{"n":113,"text":"स्वबाहुबलवीर्येण नागाश्वरथसंकुलः ।\nमहाव्यूहः कलिङ्गानामेकेन मृदितस्त्वया ॥","meaning":{"en":"\"By the strength and valor of your arms alone, you have crushed the great formation of the Kalingas, crowded with elephants, horses and chariots.\""}},{"n":114,"text":"एवमुक्त्वा शिनेर्नप्ता दीर्घबाहुररिंदमः ।\nरथाद्रथमभिद्रुत्य पर्यष्वजत पाण्डवम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having said this, the grandson of Shini, long-armed destroyer of foes, ran from his chariot to the other and embraced the Pandava."}},{"n":115,"text":"ततः स्वरथमारुह्य पुनरेव महारथः ।\nतावकानवधीत्क्रुद्धो भीमस्य बलमादधत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Then, mounting his own chariot again, the great chariot-warrior, angered, killed your men, lending strength to Bhima's side."}}]}]}